      "content": "LLMs process 'tokens' — chunks of ~2-4 characters, not words. 'ChatGPT' = 2-3 tokens. Context window\n\nLLMs process 'tokens' — chunks of ~2-4 characters, not words. 'ChatGPT' = 2-3 tokens. Context windows and API pricing are in tokens. Tokenizers trained on English text penalize other languages: Spanish/French ~30% more tokens, Japanese/Chinese 4-5x more. Non-English users get less effective context and pay more per word. #aifacts #tokenization #llm #chatgpt #aiexplained",
